[TEXT] **Root cause confirmed.** The BGP table on both leaf routers shows **2 paths available** but only **1 installed as best** — the tiebreaker is Router ID (spine_router_0_0 wins with 172.16.0.1 < 172.16.0.3). Neither leaf has `maximum-paths` configured, so FRR never installs the second ECMP path into the FIB. Let me also check the spine configs and verify the super_spine→spine_router_0_0 prefix issue:
